<title>JAPAN: Okinawa Sekiyu to shut topper March to mid-April.</title>
<headline>Okinawa Sekiyu to shut topper March to mid-April.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okinawa Sekiyu Seisei Co Ltd said on Friday it would close its 110,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit on Japan's southern island of Okinawa for about 40 days from early March for routine maintenance checks.</p>
<p>Okinawa Sekiyu is wholly owned by Idemitsu Kosan Co Ltd.</p>
